Generates an application or an independent runtime plugin crate

Usage: leptoskit generate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  app     Generates an application (also available as `leptoskit new`)
  plugin  Generates an independently publishable runtime plugin with an echo method
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
